{"4540200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alchemix", "steam_appid": 4540200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemix is an <strong>alchemist and mixologist simulator</strong>. Talk with customers to learn more about their needs and preferences. Hunt down the rarest &amp; high-quality ingredients to process them with minigames to create high quality mixes and magical recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by games such as Potion Craft, Potionomics, Fruitbus, Tavern Manager Simulator, Ale &amp; Tale Tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALCHEMY &amp; MIXOLOGY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different recipes and master concoctions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sort through numerous ingredients and buy the best from the bunch for your recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place ingredients strategically to get the most from their effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a variety of minigames throughout the process and get the highest quality outputs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540200/extras/f3d4cfc72d1a746154acbfd8bc6ee39f.poster.avif?t=1781685028\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540200/extras/f3d4cfc72d1a746154acbfd8bc6ee39f.webm?t=1781685028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4540200/extras/f3d4cfc72d1a746154acbfd8bc6ee39f.mp4?t=1781685028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTERACT WITH CUSTOMERS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p 